WEBVTT

00:01:35.660 --> 00:01:42.080
Nevertheless, I'm quite surprised that such beautiful and young people are members of Circus.

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:48.250
Hearing that from a person who's in charge of the Lindain Group at the young age of 42 years old...

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:51.210
I'm not sure if I should be glad.

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:54.300
But that is my honest impression.

00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:00.560
Well then, how may we be of help?

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:03.600
To be frank with you,

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:08.600
it appears that some companies associated with the Gardo Corporation are harboring monsters.

00:02:08.610 --> 00:02:10.610
Ice Cream Parade
Score 11

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:14.570
Here's the Walking Iron Castle, Vantam.

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:18.580
It's our long-awaited day off, so let's make the best of it!

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:21.490
Nai-chan, where do you want to go?

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:24.080
Well, let's see…

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:25.370
Say…

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:26.960
Where? Jiki-kun?

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:28.960
I'll go off on my own.

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:31.380
What? Come on, let's go together!

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:34.130
There are a few shops I'd like to check out.

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:37.470
Hey, Jiki-kun!

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:49.640
Next: my number-one recommended shop!

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:53.020
Here it is!

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:54.020
Wow!

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:55.530
We're not going in here.

00:02:55.530 --> 00:02:59.280
Huh? What? But Nai-chan looks
like he's having fun!

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:01.160
Stop it. That's enough. Shut up...
You should enjoy yourself here too, Gareki-kun!

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:02.410
There are so many Nyanperona goods here!

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:05.660
Shut up... You've gotta be kidding me!

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:07.370
Damn you.

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:09.960
Who gives a shit about Nyanperona?!

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:12.750
It's just a stupid character costume to dress up in!

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:15.000
I have absolutely no interest in that crap!

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:21.390
Wh-Why are you lying, Gareki-kun?

00:03:21.390 --> 00:03:23.760
Nyanperona is alive and doing just fine!

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:27.640
He is in no way just a character costume!

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:34.440
You shouldn't have said all that, Gareki-kun.

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:35.860
Hey!

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:43.540
Ah, well, Nyanperona really exists, you know!

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:50.620
The last 3 digits of your card number, Z-Z-A.

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:54.670
This is the undisclosed exclusive code for the National Defense Organization.

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:57.250
Also, from what you just said a second ago,

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:01.130
it's obvious that you're the one in the Nyanperona getup!

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:04.600
Nyanperona is <i>alive</i>... You're ruining the children's dreams!

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:07.010
What do you want, brat?
Nyanperona is <i>alive</i>... You're ruining the children's dreams!

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:09.310
Don't call me a brat!

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:10.270
I'm Yanari.

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:13.230
Yanari…-kun?

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:17.020
I'm looking for a pasta shop with a blue roof and a black gate.

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:20.200
If you don't want me to expose the secret of Nyanperona,

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:22.530
find that pasta shop for me!

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:28.780
Even though it's the same type of soil, there are subtle differences.

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:32.790
It's much the same with seedlings and soils; you've got to examine them carefully before buying.

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:36.380
And speaking of examining, those uniforms aren't half-bad...

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:39.970
Excuse me.

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:44.010
Azana, every time I see you, you seem to have more cuts.

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:50.260
It would appear that nothing unusual has happened at Vinto since then.

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:54.060
Right. Also, the poachers' organization has been busted.

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:56.850
That's wonderful news.

00:04:58.280 --> 00:05:00.270
Hirato-san was here, wasn't he?

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:03.700
Yeah, he was. So?

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:07.740
Oh, right, you two don't get along.

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:12.910
Well, I was wondering if he found any clues.

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:19.510
I don't blame you for being suspicious,

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:22.050
but there's no traitor in the Research Tower.

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:30.310
We don't know the identity of the person who
pretended to be your subordinate at Vinto.

00:05:30.310 --> 00:05:34.560
But it's true that information is leaking.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:42.190
No, he doesn't seem to have found anything yet.

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:50.200
There's no evidence, but the rate at which they replace their employees is abnormal.

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:52.910
What's even more interesting, people who have left the companies...

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:58.210
soon mysteriously died from sickness, got killed in accidents, or went missing.

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:01.960
This isn't known to the public, but there was...

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:07.340
a party held by Mr. Palnedo at an establishment owned by Gardo Corporation.

00:06:08.390 --> 00:06:13.180
My acquaintance, who was invited to that party, has gone missing.

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:14.850
I see.

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:21.860
That place is no longer one for the living, is it?

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:25.410
Filled with the power of man's spirit.

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:25.780
Ba-zing!

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:28.280
I'm the Sparkling Prince who makes your hearts throb.

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:36.120
The Second Ship Fighter of the National Defense Organization, Circus, Yog– Nyanperona

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:41.170
...is here!

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:46.180
For some reason, he doesn't look that attractive when he's not in the Nyanperona costume.

00:06:47.930 --> 00:06:50.550
I only did it because you asked me to.

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:54.060
Someone is watching us.

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:01.400
Why are you staring at us?

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:03.650
Take off that head and show your face.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:06.150
I... I...

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:08.610
Stop, Gareki-kun!

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:11.580
What do you think you're doing in front of the children?!

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:13.620
Their dreams are important!

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:16.580
I'm... I'm Rissun!

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:20.080
You're a mascot of Vantam, aren't you?

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:22.830
I'm the guide for this city!

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:30.470
Then, do you know the pasta shop with a blue roof and a black gate?

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:32.300
My friend wants to go there.

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:35.560
We couldn't find it even after searching for it online.

00:07:35.560 --> 00:07:39.770
Oh, if that's what you're looking for, it should be in area E-22.

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:40.850
Really?

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:47.480
Please have a memorable day with your friend!

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:51.070
Thank you, Rissun-san!

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:06.170
Nai, you said that I was your friend earlier.

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:09.720
How did we become friends?

00:08:10.430 --> 00:08:12.170
How?

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:17.050
How do you recognize someone as a friend?

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:20.930
I don't know.

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:22.940
What?

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:23.940
But...

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:32.320
Um, well... it happens when you start to feel all warm inside.

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:35.950
Fool!

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:37.700
I told you to keep an eye on him!

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:40.500
What are you going to do if he becomes a target again?!

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:43.080
What seems to be the trouble?

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:47.590
Oh, it seems that my son sneaked out of his room.

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:53.390
My subordinates are currently somewhere in the city,

00:08:53.390 --> 00:08:55.590
I'll have them look for him, just in case.

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:01.350
An emergency order?

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:03.980
Locate a nine-year-old boy.

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:06.730
The son of the president of Lindain Group?

00:09:07.110 --> 00:09:09.360
Bluish-black hair…

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:11.360
<i>Wearing a blazer and a pair of breeches.</i>

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:13.570
<i>Name is Yanari.</i>

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:16.660
Isn't that…

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:18.780
Rissun-san!

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:24.670
Did you follow us?

00:09:24.670 --> 00:09:26.170
A-Ahem.

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:29.590
Your voice... Who are you?

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:32.840
What? No!

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:34.800
Don't move!

00:09:42.940 --> 00:09:44.850
What do you think you're doing?

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:47.560
Using that costume... you disgust me.

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:50.440
Don't move!

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:53.110
We've been looking for you, Yanari-sama!

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:54.910
Are you okay?

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:56.400
Come, this way please.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:58.120
N-No!

00:09:58.120 --> 00:09:59.410
I'm not going home yet!

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:01.500
I still have something I need to do!

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:04.960
Yanari-kun has somewhere he wants to go.

00:10:09.550 --> 00:10:13.420
Let us, Circus, take care of these scoundrels.

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:15.800
Hirato-san?

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:20.810
The blondie is trying to escape with the boy.

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:21.680
Go after him.

00:10:23.730 --> 00:10:25.980
Huh? What?

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:26.810
Oh!

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:35.360
<i>Hirato-san let us escape.</i>

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:37.240
<i>What a nice guy!</i>

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:47.040
Is this the pasta shop?

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:48.210
No, it's not.

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:49.790
But this is the right place.

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:53.040
I can finally see my mother.

00:10:53.550 --> 00:11:01.930
Mother?

00:11:08.650 --> 00:11:10.730
Yanari...-san?

00:11:14.030 --> 00:11:16.230
She passed away due to an accident a month ago.

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:20.740
Sorry, we couldn't inform you of the funeral

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:23.240
because we didn't have any means of contacting you.

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:26.870
No, I should be the one apologizing.

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:28.880
Thank you...

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:36.380
Yogi, Yanari-kun is hurting a lot inside, but I…

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:38.970
Well, ah..

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:55.820
What is it, Nai?

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:57.270
Yanari-kun.

00:11:58.240 --> 00:12:00.070
Don't surprise me like that.

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:25.220
Why am I the one getting tied up?

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:28.890
For not only breaking the hearts of the children in the city,

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:31.480
but also exposing our children to danger.

00:12:33.860 --> 00:12:35.320
Is that so?

00:12:35.320 --> 00:12:36.900
I think Yogi is pretty flexible.

00:12:37.570 --> 00:12:38.820
What are you talking about?

00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:41.150
I meant Nai and you.

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:45.660
What? Why are you calling me your kid?

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:49.830
What are you smiling about?!

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:51.540
It's nothing.

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:58.790
Then, Gareki, would you like to become one of the children of the Second Ship?

00:13:00.260 --> 00:13:01.010
Come again?

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:11.690
When my mother left the house because she'd had enough of my father's work,

00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:15.770
I thought she abandoned me.

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:19.110
I secretly asked someone to take me to see her.

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:30.120
But when she looked at me, I ignored her.

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:33.670
I did an awful thing.

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:36.750
I'm such a horrible person!

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:39.880
Yanari-kun, that's not true.

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:40.840
Yes, it is!

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:44.670
That's why I haven't been able to make any friends!

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:47.810
Because my father does bad things in his line of work,

00:13:47.810 --> 00:13:50.100
he's disliked by many people.

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:52.430
I'll probably end up becoming just like him!

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:57.520
No, I've already become like him.

00:13:58.570 --> 00:14:02.730
And so I'll become worse, and worse, and worse,

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:04.690
until I'm as bad as it gets!

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:15.630
That's not something you should be telling yourself.

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:25.550
You're feeling hurt because you hurt your mother.

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:29.010
That makes you a kind person, Yanari-kun.

00:14:31.270 --> 00:14:36.150
No matter where you are, you can be strong while maintaining that pure heart of yours.

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:38.350
As long as you stand firmly in what you believe.

00:14:39.150 --> 00:14:42.860
Also, you already have friends, don't you?

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:44.400
Us.

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:51.660
Gareki-kun, who isn't here right now... even Tsukumo, who's outside – all of us are your friends.

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:53.330
Excuse me.

00:14:56.210 --> 00:15:01.420
I made that for my mother.

00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:09.930
Yanari. It's your birthday.

00:15:10.310 --> 00:15:11.720
Happy birthday.

00:15:15.730 --> 00:15:19.560
How are you? Have you grown?

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:25.940
Yanari, I'm sorry.

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:31.200
Yanari, I love you.

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:47.050
You know... When I'm Nyanperona,

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:53.050
whenever I meet children and spend time with them, even for a short time,

00:15:53.810 --> 00:15:55.600
I feel that we are binded by fate.

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:56.680
Fate?

00:15:57.520 --> 00:16:01.690
That's why, Nai-chan, we should properly bid him farewell.

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:06.240
Nai, thank you.

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:11.400
When you held my hand, I felt so relieved.

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:12.870
Thank you!

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:18.290
Gareki and Yogi did that for me.

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:21.040
And Karoku too.

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:23.670
Karoku?

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:26.340
I'm looking for Karoku.

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:29.970
That name... I think I've heard it somewhere before.

00:16:29.970 --> 00:16:33.590
Yanari-kun, we should be leaving.

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:40.560
Yogi, Nyanperona is cool because you're in it.

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:42.730
R-Really?

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:51.360
Gareki, you weren't too bad when you fought with that fake Rissun.

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:52.950
You brat.

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:58.160
Nai, I bought this for my mother.

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:59.370
Use it.

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:03.040
You're my very first friend.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:05.500
Yes.

00:17:13.890 --> 00:17:18.510
Today was an extremely memorable day for me.

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:29.110
<i>Would you like to become one of the children of the Second Ship?</i>

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:30.570
<i>What's that supposed to mean?</i>

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:32.490
<i>Shitty four-eyes.</i>

00:17:32.490 --> 00:17:35.900
<i>I don't understand him at all.</i>

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:40.280
Nai-chan.

00:17:41.210 --> 00:17:42.040
Call for you.

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:44.830
A call?

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:46.500
Hello, is it Nai?

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:49.000
Yanari-kun?

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:52.260
The name of the person Karoku, whom you're looking for...

00:17:52.260 --> 00:17:52.880
Eh?

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:56.550
It was mentioned by a girl in the selection school I was attending.

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:59.270
As I recall, her name is Erisyuka.

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:01.640
<i>Erisyuka?</i>

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:05.640
<i>Does that mean I'll be working for the ship?</i>

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:10.730
<i>I've been with Nai because I thought he would bring me money.</i>

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:15.360
<i>I was going to take advantage of all that I could.</i>

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:17.200
<i>That's why I'm here.</i>

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:19.160
<i>But...</i>

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:24.290
<i>Since when did things that felt so normal to me make me feel so suffocated?</i>

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:29.750
Gareki, I brought you a cup of juice.

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:32.130
Thank you.

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:37.600
<i>I don't want to stand beside them feeling this way. </i>

00:18:38.390 --> 00:18:40.340
<i>I can't stay here if I remain like this.</i>

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:47.770
<i>Let's talk, Nai.</i>

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:51.030
<i>Come down.</i>

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:53.860
Nai!

00:18:57.780 --> 00:19:00.570
<i>Nai, you're late.</i>

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:03.910
Karoku, where are you?

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:06.330
<i>You didn't want to say good-bye to your friends?</i>

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:10.420
<i>That's so nice of you. But I can't see you yet, Nai.</i>

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:12.210
Why did you leave me?

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:15.590
I was forcefully taken away.

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:20.140
Karoku, where have you been taken away to?

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:21.600
Tell me!

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:24.350
I'll try my best to find you!

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:27.560
<i>Then... come right away.</i>

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:33.730
<i>I'll be killed before long.</i>

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:38.870
<i>My location is...</i>

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:43.160
Nai-kun, are you okay?

00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:48.500
He's at... the Smoky Mansion...

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:50.920
The Smoky Mansion?

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:53.000
Karoku is there.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:57.250
Tsukumo-chan, I'll go to the Smoky Mansion.

00:19:58.220 --> 00:20:02.260
Karoku… Karoku will be killed.

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:09.020
That place is difficult to get close to.

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:13.150
The Smoky Mansion is one of Kafka's main research institutions.

00:20:14.030 --> 00:20:20.200
I hear that there hasn't been enough evidence to raid the place so far.

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:24.660
If you approach it carelessly, all our efforts thus far will be for naught.

00:20:25.250 --> 00:20:29.620
Unless you have concrete evidence,
the higher-ups will not allow us to go there.

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:35.260
Erisyuka, the granddaughter of Palnedo, has connections with Karoku, right?

00:20:35.260 --> 00:20:39.380
It would be tough to present the memories of Yanari-kun alone as evidence.

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:43.840
I'm going, no matter what.

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:46.680
What can you do even if you go?

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:51.350
I have to! Otherwise, Karoku will be killed!

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:53.350
Nai-chan...

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:57.320
Karoku said to "come right away."

00:20:58.070 --> 00:21:01.030
So if I have to, I'll go alone.

00:21:03.660 --> 00:21:04.780
I'll go.

00:21:05.870 --> 00:21:07.870
I'm not a member of Circus,

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:10.000
so it'd just be considered trespassing even if I'm caught.

00:21:10.710 --> 00:21:13.410
And if we can find some evidence, you guys would be able to act, wouldn't you?

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:15.750
What if something happens to you?!

00:21:16.590 --> 00:21:19.420
In that case, I'll leave my ID behind and go!

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:20.670
I'll go too.

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:36.600
Hirato-san.

00:21:37.280 --> 00:21:37.940
I...

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:39.440
Calm down.

00:21:41.030 --> 00:21:42.280
You may go.

00:21:43.950 --> 00:21:45.450
I'll take full responsibility.

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:49.200
Under the pretext of saving Karoku, we'll assault the target.

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:54.960
We'll take them on as Circus.

00:23:25.760 --> 00:23:28.060
Each one of us is different.

00:23:28.060 --> 00:23:32.730
Long ears, eye color, voice, behavior and clothes... all of them are exactly the same, aren't they?

00:23:32.730 --> 00:23:35.940
Take a good look at us. You will soon see the difference.

00:23:35.940 --> 00:23:38.940
Don't you rabbits all say the same thing? You wanna bet?
